    "A poor sleep can have a negative effect on your stress level for the following day. Try to get enough sleep each night to help keep your stress levels low.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une mauvaise nuit peut faire grimper votre niveau de stress le lendemain. Essayez de dormir suffisamment chaque nuit pour garder votre stress au plus bas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
