    "Text": {},
    "Thank You!": {},
    "Thank you so much for help testing Bloom! We're ending our TestFlight program, so you'll need to install the App Store version of the app to continue using Bloom.": {},
    "Thanks Bud!": {},
    "That's Cool!": {},
    "The Bristol Stool Types are a standard mechanism to help categorize bowel movements. They can help provide insights into your gut health.": {},
    "The following message content will be submitted with the report.": {},
    "There are currently no pending notifications scheduled for this app.": {},
    "There are no workouts to show.": {},
    "There is no sleep analysis available for %@.": {},
    "There is no sleep data for last night.": {},
    "There was a problem loading the weather.": {},
    "There's room to improve next year.": {},
    "This can help tailor my advice to you.": {},
    "This chart shows how your time was distributed across different sleep stages each night. A healthy sleep pattern includes cycles through all stages.": {},
    "This chart shows your average HRV for each time of day over the selected period. HRV is typically higher during sleep and lower during active periods.": {},
    "This chart shows your sleep schedule over time. Each bar represents a night of sleep, starting at your bedtime and ending at your wake time. A consistent sleep schedule helps regulate your circadian rhythm and improves sleep quality.": {},
    "This helps me personalize your insights and make sure Bloom is the right fit.": {},
    "This is %@ for your age!": {
      "comment": "Year in Bloom resting heart rate feedback. The placeholder is a rating such as \"excellent\"."
    },
    "This monitor tracks early physiological signs that may indicate your body is fighting off illness or needs extra recovery time. It analyzes your resting heart rate, heart rate variability, wrist temperature, and respiratory rate to detect subtle changes from your personal baseline.": {},
    "This monitor tracks your sleep patterns including duration, efficiency, and schedule consistency. It detects when your sleep is declining or when your bedtime and wake time are becoming irregular, which can affect your circadian rhythm and overall health.": {},
    "This monitor tracks your training load using Apple's Workout Effort Scores. It compares your recent 7-day training load to your 28-day average to help you avoid overtraining or detraining. HRV trends and recovery metrics are also considered when available.": {},
    "This range is considered normal for the general population. People within this range have a balanced level of body fat, contributing to overall health and well-being.": {},
    "This range is typical for athletes who require higher muscle mass and lower fat levels for optimal performance. It reflects a high level of fitness and conditioning.": {},
    "This timeline shows how you transitioned between sleep stages throughout the night. Your body naturally cycles through these stages multiple times.": {},
    "This type can be caused by dietary issues, infections, stress, or other gastrointestinal problems. It’s important to stay hydrated and, if persistent, consider evaluating for potential infections or intolerances.": {},
    "This type indicates a healthy gut with slight indication of dehydration. Maintaining a balanced diet with sufficient fiber and hydration is recommended.": {},
    "This type indicates constipation. This can be caused by dehydration, lack of fiber, or other digestive issues. It may be beneficial to increase fluid intake and dietary fiber.": {},
    "This type indicates mild constipation. You might need to improve your diet, increase hydration, and consider physical activity to help regularize bowel movements.": {},
    "This type is the ideal stool. This indicates a healthy digestive system with normal bowel function. Continue with your current diet and lifestyle.": {},
    "This type may indicate a dietary change, mild digestive upset, or a temporary imbalance in your gut.": {},
    "This type represents severe diarrhea. This could indicate a significant gastrointestinal issue, such as an infection, food poisoning, or a chronic condition. It’s crucial to stay hydrated and seek medical advice if this persists.": {},
    "This will remove all custom containers and restore the default container sizes.": {},
    "Time": {},
    "Time Of Day": {},
    "Time Period": {},
    "Time Range": {},
    "Time between bowel movements helps indicate digestive health and regularity patterns.": {},
    "Time between bowel movements helps indicate digestive health and regularity. Consistent patterns are generally healthier.": {},
    "Title": {},
    "To chat with Bud about your health, you’ll need to turn Chat back on. You’re always in control of what data gets used.": {},
    "To help you stay on top of your health and reach your goals, I need your permission for a few things.": {},
    "To keep helping you with personalized health insights, and to provide personalized responses to your questions, I need your permission for a few things. You’re always in control of what you share.": {},
    "To show your workout history, we need access to your personal data. You can manage this permission at any time.": {},
